Subject: [PATCH 07584/11362] [outer-loop] REQ-ARC-WMTE-5828: seed the
 tool-loop A/B, document budget-inconclusive result

Closed the legitimate adversarial_verify.py METHODOLOGY_MISSING(random_seed)
flag by threading a real llama.cpp /completion seed through
run_tool_loop -> ToolLoopLookaheadSession -> _completion (offset per
search-node decision and per tool-loop turn). Re-ran the 3-game A/B
clean (0 flags now).

Result: honest negative (levels_gained=0 on sc25/lf52/bp35, matching
both the induce-then-plan and bare reactive-filter baselines) -- but
states_expanded came back only 16/16/18 total across the whole search
tree, far too shallow to plausibly reach these games' known 13-33+
action winning-sequence depths. Documented this as budget-inconclusive,
not a clean architectural refutation, in ops/verifier_gaps.md
(GAP-ARC-TOOL-LOOP-LOOKAHEAD-BUDGET-INCONCLUSIVE), the spec.md RESULT
addendum, and a dated ops/known-issues.md entry.

